OL,3,ALondon mayor says conviction for
OL,4,Auntaxed car was due to a scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FCourt documents show that DVLA letters
OL,7,Faddressed to the mayor about the unpaid
OL,8,Ftax bill were sent to Gordon Ramsay's
OL,9,Feast London restaurant, instead of the
OL,10,Fnearby Transport for London (TfL)
OL,11,Foffices.
OL,13,FCity Hall officials said the car did
OL,14,Fnot belong to the mayor or TfL.
